# Scenario "new-game" (US, milestone 7, native memory card always present): title screen -> New Game ->
# file 1 (empty) -> the game creates its save CHIBIROBO(0) -> 3D introduction (first dialogue).
# Same logical path as ../new-game.scn (PAL); frames recorded on GGTE01 (native card, cycle
# clock, RTC 800000000, fresh user folder). Effect: <user folder>/saves/01-GGTE-CHIBIROBO(0).gci.
name new-game
description Title screen, New Game, file 1: creates the save on the native card, then 3D intro (US).
version GGTE01
window 4

input  450 A       # health and safety warning
input 1600 A       # title screen: New Game (empty card: cursor on New Game)
input 1900 A       # New Game file selection screen: file 1 -> save created

check  400 health-warning
check 1500 title-screen
check 1800 new-game-file-select
check 2060 loading soft
check 3000 birthday-dialogue

end 3150
